<title>TAIWAN: President Jan-Sept pretax up 37.5 pct.</title>
<headline>President Jan-Sept pretax up 37.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>January-September 1996</p>
<p>			 (in million T$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Turnover			    20,647 vs 19,456</p>
<p>    Pretax profit			2,271 vs  1,652</p>
<p>NOTE - President Enterprises Corp is Taiwan's largest food processor. The firm has set a 1996 pretax profit target of T$4.6 billion on sales of T$27.2 billion, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (5080815)</p>
</text>
